--------------------- OPTIONS ------------------------------------------------
9.80665  g                 - Gravitational acceleration (m/s^2) [default: 9.80665]
1025.0   rhoW              - Water density (kg/m^3) [default: 1025]
30.0     WtrDpth           - Water depth for the flat seabed (m) [default: absent standalone; host value in OpenFAST]
1.0e5    kBot              - Seabed penalty stiffness base (Pa/m) [default: 1.0e5]
1.0e4    cBot              - Seabed normal damping base (Pa-s/m) [default: 1.0e4]
none      frictionMu       - Seabed friction coefficient {none=0=off; value>=0} [default: none]
static    bodyIC           - Free Rigid6 body / rod start {static=equilibrium; deck=deck pose} [default: static]
sphere    bodyWetting      - Rigid6 submergence {sphere=equivalent sphere; moordyn=always wet} [default: sphere]
morison   bodyHydro        - Rigid6 fluid inertia {morison=with Froude-Krylov; moordyn=without} [default: morison]
exact     rodHydro         - Rod waterplane moment {exact=displaced volume; moordyn=MoorDyn term} [default: exact]
monolithic bodyScheme      - Bodies/rods/points step {monolithic=implicit; staggered=partitioned} [default: monolithic]
accuracy  bodySubstep      - Monolithic sub-stepping {accuracy=resolve body-mooring mode; none} [default: accuracy]
0.4       rhoInf           - Generalised-alpha spectral radius {0<=rhoInf<=1} [default: 0.4]
0.5       maxStrain        - Per-step plausibility bound on EI=0 element strain {>=0; 0=off} [default: 0.5]
False     modified_newton  - Tangent-reuse mode {False=full Newton; True=guarded reuse} [default: False]
True      cable_load_feedback - Return finite-EI cable reactions to OpenFAST {False; True} [default: True]
False     adaptive_mesh    - Automatic finite-EI refinement {False; True} [default: False]
continuation cable_statics - Finite-EI static route order {continuation; sequenced} [default: continuation]
True      alpha_force_blend - Finite-EI generalised-alpha force blend {True; False=configuration blend} [default: True]
False     tensile_safety   - Element-mean axial-force audit {False; warn; True=reject} [default: False]
2.0e-6    tensile_strain_tolerance - Dynamic audit strain band [default: 2.0e-6]
1024      recovery_max_substeps - Internal dynamic-step recovery ceiling {4..65536} [default: 1024]
4         axial_quadrature_order   - Finite-EI axial Gauss order {integer 1..6} [default: 4]
4         bending_quadrature_order - Finite-EI bending Gauss order {integer 1..6} [default: 4]
dynamic_solver 1.0e-8 1.0e-14 30 12 - Relative tolerance, absolute tolerance, max iterations, backtracks [defaults shown]
-- dynamic_solver 1.0e-8 1.0e-14 30 12 0.4 - Optional sixth token also sets rhoInf (overrides the rhoInf row)
none      current           - Current model and velocity (m/s), in the static IC {none; uniform; profile} [default: none]
none      waves             - Wave model and parameters (m, s, deg) {none; airy; jonswap} + models below [default: none]
1         WaveSeed          - JONSWAP random-phase seed {integer 1..2147483646; same seed = same sea} [default: 1]
0.0       rampTime          - Half-cosine start-up ramp of the waves (s) {>=0; 0=off} [default: 0]
0         WaterKin         - Water-kinematics source {0/none; file; SEASTATE coupled only} [default: no policy]
-- 0.025  dtM               - Standalone/module step (s); standalone dynamics require dtM and TMax
-- 10.0   TMax              - Standalone duration (s); OpenFAST owns run duration
-- 0.0    RangeStart        - Range-graph window start (s); needs TMax and a LINES Outputs flag r [default: 0]
-- "motion.txt" motionFile  - Prescribed standalone Coupled/Vessel/Body motion {0/none disables}; active path requires dtM and TMax
-- "vessel.txt" vesselMotion - 6-DOF vessel record moving every Coupled/Vessel point rigidly {alternative to motionFile}
-- "rao.txt" vesselRAO      - Displacement RAO table: vessel motion from the deck waves {alternative to motionFile}
-- 0.0|0.0|0.0 vesselRef    - Vessel reference point / rotation centre / RAO origin (m) [default: 0|0|0]
-- "bathymetry.txt" bathymetryFile - Structured x/y/depth seabed; mutually exclusive with WtrDpth
-- uniform 1.0 0.0 0.0 current - Uniform X/Y/Z current velocity (m/s)
-- profile -30 0.2 0 0 0 0.5 0 0 current - Two-level z/vx/vy/vz current profile (m, m/s)
-- airy 2.0 8.0 0.0 waves - Airy height, period, direction (m, s, deg)
-- jonswap 3.0 10.0 3.3 0.0 waves - JONSWAP Hs, Tp, gamma, direction (m, s, -, deg)
-- stream 6.0 10.0 0.0 waves - Regular stream-function wave height, period, direction (m, s, deg)
-- pm 3.0 10.0 0.0 waves     - Pierson-Moskowitz Hs, Tp, direction (m, s, deg)
-- torsethaugen 3.0 10.0 0.0 waves - Torsethaugen Hs, Tp, direction (m, s, deg)
-- ochihubble 2.0 12.0 3.0 2.0 7.0 1.0 0.0 waves - Ochi-Hubble Hs1 Tp1 lambda1 Hs2 Tp2 lambda2 direction
-- 0       StreamOrder      - Fourier terms of a stream wave {0=20; 2 to 60} [default: 0]
-- 0.0     WaveSpreading    - cos-2s spreading exponent of a spectral waves row {0=long-crested} [default: 0]
-- 9       WaveDirections   - Direction bins of a spread sea or train {>=1} [default: 9]
-- 200     WaveComponents   - Frequency components per train and direction {>=2} [default: 200]
-- jonswap 3.0 7.0 3.3 0.0 6.0 wavetrain - One train of a multi-train sea: Hs, Tp, gamma, dir, s (no waves row)
-- 3       WaterKin         - MoorDyn-C WaveKin 3/7: wave_elevation.txt / wave_frequencies.txt in the deck folder
-- 0.5     frictionMuAxial  - Seabed friction along the line axis {>=0} [default: frictionMu]
-- 0.5     frictionMuLateral - Seabed friction across the line axis {>=0} [default: frictionMu]
-- 0       nModes           - Modal analysis: lowest natural modes per line {0=off; 1 to 1000} [default: 0]
-- "WaterKin.dat" WaterKin - MoorDyn-F WaterKin file (standalone file modes or coupled host selectors)
-- SEASTATE WaterKin        - Full host SeaState field (OpenFAST aggregate only)
-- RK2     tScheme          - MoorDyn compatibility only; accepted and ignored by CableDyn
-- 0.001   dtIC             - MoorDyn dynamic-relaxation compatibility only; accepted and ignored
-- 60.0    TmaxIC           - MoorDyn dynamic-relaxation compatibility only; accepted and ignored
-- 0.1     CdScaleIC        - MoorDyn dynamic-relaxation compatibility only; accepted and ignored
-- 0.01    threshIC         - MoorDyn dynamic-relaxation compatibility only; accepted and ignored
-- 0       WriteLog         - MoorDyn logging compatibility only; accepted and ignored
-- 0.1     dtOut            - MoorDyn output-cadence compatibility only; accepted and ignored
-- 0       Currents         - MoorDyn-C current mode {0=none; 1=current_profile.txt} [default: 0]
-- 0.25    dtWave           - MoorDyn-C WaveKin 3 resampling step (s) [default: 0.25]
-- Keyword aliases (equivalent spellings, case-insensitive):
--   g = gravity; rhoW = WtrDnsty = water_density; WtrDpth = water_depth; kBot = kb; cBot = cb
--   bathymetryFile = bathymetry_file = seafloorFile = seafloor_file; frictionMu = mu = frictionCoefficient
--   dtM = dt; rhoInf = rho_inf; modified_newton = modifiedNewton; adaptive_mesh = adaptiveMesh
--   cable_statics = cableStatics; alpha_force_blend = alphaForceBlend
--   maxStrain = max_strain; WaveSeed = wave_seed; rampTime = ramp_time = tRamp
--   RangeStart = range_start
--   cable_load_feedback = cableLoadFeedback; tensile_safety = tensileSafety
--   tensile_strain_tolerance = tensileStrainTolerance; recovery_max_substeps = recoveryMaxSubsteps
--   axial_quadrature_order = axialQuadratureOrder = axial_quadrature
--   bending_quadrature_order = bendingQuadratureOrder = bending_quadrature
--   waves = wave; WaterKin = WaveKin
-- Logical values: True/T/yes/y/on/1 and False/F/no/n/off/0; tensile_safety also accepts
--   error (= True) and warn/warning/monitor
